<title>BRAZIL: FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Individual survey of Brazilian indicators.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are individual forecasts on the Brazilian economy collected by Reuters from the offices of eight brokerages and research firms in Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro.</p>
<p>The survey is updated twice monthly after the release of export figures early in the month and the Brazilian trade balance later in the month.</p>
<p>	 *****Brazil Individual Economic Forecasts*****</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
